  "details": "en_us--Description\n\nDue to # Quest Content Limitations , Providing A Non-Destructive Asset (for example：Modular Avatar OR VRCFury Prefab) that contain Android umcompatibility component, Asset Creator will need to provide Android Compatible Prefab and Animator with matched Exparameter for #Cross-Platform Parameter Sync.\n\n[Quest Content Limitations]\n\nhttps://creators.vrchat.com/platforms/android/quest-content-limitations#components\n\n[Cross-Platform Parameter Sync]\n\nhttps://creators.vrchat.com/avatars/animator-parameters/#cross-platform-parameter-sync\n\nProviding A official \"Platform\" parameter can make Creator maintenance Cross-Platform for diiffrent state condition, And make a Prefab(PC) and Prefab variant(Android) for more easy asset developement .\n\nbuild PC/Android seprete preset Like \"IsWindows\" bool without sync ON will work as same as The above solution , But provide a Build-in parameter should make A future-proof workaround for different platform limitation.",
